OL,3,AFrance links sharp rise in drownings to
OL,4,Aheatwaves
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrance has seen 301 drownings since 19
OL,7,FJune, a government minister has said,
OL,8,Flinking the sharp rise in deaths from
OL,9,Flast year to a series of prolonged
OL,10,Fheatwaves.
OL,12,FSports and Youth Minister Marina
OL,13,FFerrari told France Inter radio the
OL,14,Fnumber of deaths - a 14% hike on 2025 -
OL,15,Fwas a "tragic toll".
OL,17,FFrance, Spain and Italy have all been
OL,18,Fhit by heatwaves that have triggered
OL,19,Fmassive wildfires that have scorched
OL,20,Fthousands of hectares of land this
OL,21,Fsummer.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
