OL,3,AFrance links sharp rise in drownings to
OL,4,Aheatwaves
OL,5,
OL,6,FFerrari said people had been taking
OL,7,Frisks by going into the water, adding:
OL,8,F"Many deadly accidents have occurred in
OL,9,Fareas that are not authorised or
OL,10,Fsupervised for swimming."
